{"2996330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TheNinthFloor", "steam_appid": 2996330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《The Ninth Floor》</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way home in the elevator, something strange seems to be happening. The elevator doors keep opening inexplicably on every floor, yet there are no passengers waiting outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a first-person perspective, you will face a series of bizarre anomalies in the elevator. You must resolve or detect these abnormalities until you reach the ninth floor. Failure to do so will trap you in an endless loop of the elevator rising and plummeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, when an anomaly occurs, <strong>close the door and sound the alarm</strong> (the elevator will crash if certain anomalies are left unresolved, regardless of whether you have fixed others). If you fail to spot an anomaly, do not press the alarm button after closing the door, or the elevator will also crash.Wish you a pleasant journey home on this elevator ride!!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《The Ninth Floor》</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way home in the elevator, something strange seems to be happening. The elevator doors keep opening inexplicably on every floor, yet there are no passengers waiting outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a first-person perspective, you will face a series of bizarre anomalies in the elevator. You must resolve or detect these abnormalities until you reach the ninth floor. Failure to do so will trap you in an endless loop of the elevator rising and plummeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, when an anomaly occurs, <strong>close the door and sound the alarm</strong> (the elevator will crash if certain anomalies are left unresolved, regardless of whether you have fixed others). If you fail to spot an anomaly, do not press the alarm button after closing the door, or the elevator will also crash.Wish you a pleasant journey home on this elevator ride!!</p>", "short_description": "《The Ninth Floor》On your way home in the elevator, something strange seems to be happening. The elevator doors keep opening inexplicably on every floor, yet there are no passengers waiting outside.From a first-person perspective, you will face a series of bizarre anomalies in the elevator.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996330/4a2c236e2ff299a9f1db176d5e7be16d52535e9b/header.jpg?t=1777446045", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996330/6871312f480a4399b448bd2a45d174c873f8bb36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777446045", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996330/6871312f480a4399b448bd2a45d174c873f8bb36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777446045", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> win11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 任何<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3113 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 任何<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3113 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["世纪愚人Sophist"], "publishers": ["世纪愚人Sophist"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"